'''にゃんこ生態リポート特盛''' (''Nyanko Seitai Ripōto Toku Sakari'', '''Nyanko Ecology Report Special Edition''') is a Japanese manga that was published on October 24th, 2014 by [[wikipedia:Enterbrain|Enterbrain]]/[[wikipedia:Kadokawa Corporation|Kadokawa]].

