==Overview==
A complete and unrivalled fan book featuring over 130 of the world's most popular kimo-kawaii cat characters!

The second fan book of the popular app "The Great Cat War" which has been downloaded 10 million times worldwide<br>
This is the second fan book of "The Great Cat War".<be>
The main points of this book are…….

*Over 130 kawaii cat characters are included.
*Over 80 four-frame comics that reveal the lives of the cat characters.
*Exclusive setting documents & hand-drawn sketches!
*The producer himself introduces the key points of the characters.
*An item code to play the [[God (Special Cat)|original character]] in the game

This is a second must-have item for all kitten lovers.

