==Trivia==
*In this book, it was revealed that [[Vars (Uber Rare Cat)|Vars]]'s name is a reference to "Balus", the spell of destruction in the Studio Ghibli movie ''[[wikipedia:Castle in the Sky|Castle in the Sky]]'', itself derived from the Turkish word ''barış'' (meaning "peace"). The reference is much more obvious in Japanese, in which both ''Vars'' and ''Balus'' are written as バルス (''Barusu'').

